title: "hermes-telegram-miniapp: a Telegram Mini App control panel for Hermes Agent"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Muhammad
    family-names: Aiman
version: 0.3.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aimanmalib/hermes-telegram-miniapp"
abstract: >-
  A Hermes Agent dashboard plugin and React Mini App that shows live status, sessions, cron jobs and logs inside
  Telegram, with verified Telegram login (HMAC-SHA256 with Ed25519 fallback), a freshness window and an
  allowlist that refuses everyone until it is set.
